# Diagnostics
```
invalid-script-and-setup.vue:5:5 lint/nursery/noVueThisInBeforeRouteEnter ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × this is used in beforeRouteEnter, where it is undefined.
  
    3 │ export default {
    4 │   beforeRouteEnter() {
  > 5 │     this.method();
      │     ^^^^
    6 │   },
    7 │ };
  
  i Vue Router calls beforeRouteEnter before it creates the component, so the component can't be reached through this.
  
  i Pass a callback to next to use the component once it is created, for example next((vm) => vm.loadData()).
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

